Not included (never shipped with this folder)
  - NVIDIA's nvngx_dlssnr.dll. The network weights are read at runtime from the user's own copy (310.8 or 310.9.16);
    nr_data carries no NVIDIA weights.
  - AMD's HIP runtime (amdhip64_6.dll). It comes with the AMD Adrenalin driver.
